    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Medicines and allergies",
     "texto": [
      "**Rețetă** can be a cooking recipe or a medical prescription; the context shows the meaning. **Sunt alergică** is said by a woman; a man says **Sunt alergic**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A careful question",
     "texto": [
      "You can ask **Pot să cumpăr sirop fără rețetă?**. The answer may depend on the medicine; here we practise the question, without recommending any treatment."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
